      241.53,
      359.05,
      396.1,
      370.12
    ],
    "text": "GAMPAHA MUNICIPAL COUNCIL",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      187.53,
      374.17,
      414.05,
      400.12
    ],
    "text": "UNDER SECTION 65A(2) OF THELOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      140.01,
      404.17,
      461.61,
      430.12
    ],
    "text": "(CHAPTER 262) AS AMENDED BYLOCAL AUTHORITIES (SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT No. 30 OF 2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      441.37,
      546.36,
      465.16
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of a Member in Gampaha Municipal Council has fallen vacant by reason of being ceased to be amember of the party ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      475.45,
      546.61,
      523.96
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the recognized political party namely United People\u2019s Freedom Alliance, to whichthe former member, Appu Acharige Don Nilantha Dilruk Priyadarshana belonged, was required by me under Section 65A(2)of the aforesaid Ordinance, to nominate within a period of of thirty (30) days a person eligible under the Ordinance forelection as a member of that Gampaha Municipal Council who shall be declared elected as a member ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      534.49,
      546.65,
      558.04
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has nominated Mr. ILangakoon PathiranalageChathura Mahesh Sugath Kumara being an eligible person under the aforesaid Ordinance to fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      568.57,
      546.64,
      617.08
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE, I, Pathiraja Arachchillage Sunil Senarathna, Returning Officer of Gampaha Municipal Council,acting in terms of Section 65A(2) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance as amended by filling of Vacancies in Local.authorities (Special Provisions) Act, No. 30 of 2013 (Chapter 262) do hereby declare Mr. ILangakoon Pathiranalage ChathuraMahesh Sugath Kumara elected as a member of the Gampaha Municipal Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      446.73,
      639.61,
      527.71,
      650.68
    ],
    "text": "P. A. S. SENARATHNA,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      651.61,
      545.62,
      711.64
    ],
    "text": "Returning Officer,Gampaha Municipal Council.District Elections Office,Gampaha,10th November, 2014.",
